{
  "id": "digital-transformation-eco",
  "name": "Digital Transformation Dynamics Model",
  "description": "System dynamics model of organizational digital transformation. Captures technology adoption, capability building, resistance management, and value creation. Reference: Andersson, D. I., & Hughes, D. (2014). Microbiological effects of sublethal antibiotic concentrations. Nature Reviews Microbiology. Source: https://doi.org/10.1038/nrmicro3270",
  "source": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jbusres.2019.09.022",
  "reference": "Vial G. (2019). Understanding digital transformation: A review and a research agenda. Journal of Strategic Information Systems, 28, 118-144.",
  "stocks": [
